# MLB Parlay Agent

> AI-powered MLB parlay recommendation system using ML-based leg scoring, stat-specific calibrated predictions, pitcher-aware matchup logic, and within-batch player diversity

[![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-operational-success)](https://railway.app)
[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.10-blue)](https://python.org)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-personal%20research-lightgrey)](LICENSE)

---

## 🎯 Overview

The MLB Parlay Agent is a production system that generates daily MLB parlay recommendations by:
- Scoring 200-400 player props daily using a **calibrated ML model** (Brier: 0.2341, +16.6% improvement)
- Applying **stat-specific post-hoc calibration** to align predictions with reality (45.5% predicted = 45.5% actual)
- Using pitcher-aware matchup analysis and handedness-split coverage rates
- Enforcing **within-batch player diversity** (max 2 appearances per player per generation)
- Filtering **game start times** (fail-closed: only games starting >15 min from now)
- Building optimized 4-6 leg parlays targeting +1000 to +1500 odds
- Tracking outcomes and learning from 90,000+ historical resolved legs

**Last Major Update:** May 10, 2026 — Stat-specific calibrator deployed, game start filter fixed

